  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Preventing loss of life and shelter destruction through nature-based slope stabilization in Coxs Bazar Rohingya camps</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="2">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Reduce immediate landslide risks and safeguard lives by implementing sustainable and cost-efficient, nature-based and target bioengineering slope stabilization in high-risk areas, complemented by community sensitization to enable timely, life-saving action  Strengthen household self-reliance by engaging vulnerable households in emergency Cash-for-Work (CfW) for slope rehabilitation, providing short-term income while promoting community ownership of maintenance activities.</narrative>
  </description>
